      "id": 5,
      "prompt": "Differentiate $f(x)=\\dfrac{1}{(x^2+3)^2}$.",
      "solution": {
        "steps": [
          "Rewrite $(x^2+3)^{-2}$; outer $-2(x^2+3)^{-3}$, inner $2x$.",
          "Product: $-4x(x^2+3)^{-3}=\\frac{-4x}{(x^2+3)^3}$."
        ],
        "answer": "$f'(x)=\\dfrac{-4x}{(x^2+3)^3}$"
      }
