        "steps": [
          "$f'(x)=\\frac{1}{2}(3x+1)^{-1/2}\\cdot 3=\\frac{3}{2\\sqrt{3x+1}}$.",
          "At $x=1$: $\\frac{3}{2\\sqrt{4}}=\\frac{3}{4}$."
        ],
        "answer": "$f'(x)=\\dfrac{3}{2\\sqrt{3x+1}}$, $f'(1)=\\dfrac{3}{4}$"
